DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}
Delete a specific account (only available for tenant admins at this time). This is a permanent operation that will delete any zones or other resources under the account
Required: account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}
Get information about a specific account that you are a member of.
Required: account_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}
Update an existing account.
Required: account_id (path); body (body)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/roles/{role_id}
Get information about a specific role for an account.
Required: role_id (path); account_id (path)
